  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Manyankabi (MACE) Maize &amp; Beans Expansion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: beans and maize, Beneficiaries: 2,797 smallholder farmers (771 male, 2026 female), Summary: The project funds will be used to provide an up-to-date warehouse facility, working capital to increase the Cooperative&apos;s capacity to bulk produce as well as provide inputs to farmers, facilitate improved transport to move produce from collecting centers to the central warehouse and market, and equipment to add value to maize by processing it into higher value maize products.</narrative>
  </description>
